# SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
# Example env file for the Charli3 hackathon oracle-client.
# Copy to .env and fill in a funded Preprod wallet mnemonic before running
# scripts/submit_odv.py, scripts/demo_push.py, or the settlement release flow.
#
# Usage:
#     set -a; source oracle-client/.env; set +a
#     python oracle-client/scripts/submit_odv.py
#
# Derivation path used by charli3-pull-oracle-client: m/1852'/1815'/0'/0/0
#
# To provision a fresh wallet:
#   1. Generate a 24-word BIP-39 mnemonic on a clean machine.
#   2. Derive the base address (Preprod) at the path above.
#   3. Fund via https://docs.cardano.org/cardano-testnets/tools/faucet/.
#
WALLET_MNEMONIC="abandon abandon abandon abandon abandon abandon abandon abandon abandon abandon abandon abandon abandon abandon abandon abandon abandon abandon abandon abandon abandon abandon abandon about"
